{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Groundskeeper is 2D top down indie horror featuring a retro pixel style for a delightful and retro spooky vibe. Step into Gramen Park, conduct your nightly rounds and keep an eye on things from the warmth of your security hut. But do beware, there's something sinister lurking inside...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Groundskeeper you take on the nightshift with a job to keep Gramen Park in shape and protected. Armed with a task list and a tool shed you'll be quickly interrupted by pesky delinquents who will make your life more difficult and a faulty generator that plunges you into darkness. A darkness that may reveal a more sinister force at work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Included in this demo is the first section of The Groundskeeper - Exploring Gramen Park and will finish just before you are able to enter Gramen Manor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D horror-adventure featuring exploration and action elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expressions of violence and pixelated gore</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4092450?t=1760385993","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4092450?t=1760385993","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092450/1628f378256fc093bc3b83ad0952c725046f6222/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760385993","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092450/1628f378256fc093bc3b83ad0952c725046f6222/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760385993","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game features pixelated gore and depiction of violence and death. "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Groundskeeper is 2D top down indie horror featuring a retro pixel style for a delightful and retro spooky vibe. Step into Gramen Park, conduct your nightly rounds and keep an eye on things from the warmth of your security hut. But do beware, there's something sinister lurking inside...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Groundskeeper you take on the nightshift with a job to keep Gramen Park in shape and protected. Armed with a task list and a tool shed you'll be quickly interrupted by pesky delinquents who will make your life more difficult and a faulty generator that plunges you into darkness. A darkness that may reveal a more sinister force at work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Included in this demo is the first section of The Groundskeeper - Exploring Gramen Park and will finish just before you are able to enter Gramen Manor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D horror-adventure featuring exploration and action elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expressions of violence and pixelated gore</p></li></ul>","developers":["Fermented Oddity Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3593360","name":"The Groundskeeper"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092450/8cc9938787b0429be77dfca126020b3fdfda8cf5/header.jpg?t=1760385993","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4092450/950753531/ec8687317d3e7d33dbba3773e4b7ec77f09a1a15/1759862432/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760002441","dash_h264